          <Pad Id="NjtJKKvuC5xOvcQVd2bXL8" Bounds="85,870,840,180" ShowValueBox="true" isIOBox="true" Value="Notes:&#xD;&#xA;- The texture is premultiplied alpha. Draw it with a premultiplied blend state like AlphaBlend. Where straight alpha is expected, unpremultiply it first (RGB divided by alpha), otherwise the edges get dark fringes.&#xD;&#xA;- No input yet: Interaction nodes at elements in a QtTexture stay inert (#119).&#xD;&#xA;- An element shows only in the first renderer that uses it: do not connect the same element to a QtTexture and a Renderer [Qt] at the same time (#126).&#xD;&#xA;- Space: only DIPTopLeft for now, 1 unit = 100 DIP, origin at the top left corner of the texture.&#xD;&#xA;- Windows only (Direct3D 11). QtTexture is Experimental: pins and behavior may still change.">
            <p:TypeAnnotation LastCategoryFullName="Primitive" LastDependency="VL.CoreLib.vl">
              <Choice Kind="TypeFlag" Name="String" />
            </p:TypeAnnotation>
            <p:ValueBoxSettings>
              <p:fontsize p:Type="Int32">9</p:fontsize>
              <p:stringtype p:Assembly="VL.Core" p:Type="VL.Core.StringType">Comment</p:stringtype>
            </p:ValueBoxSettings>
          </Pad>
